	(text "REF-SENSE: gain 1, PGA bypass; +/-2.048 V.\n20 SPS normal; IDAC/burn-out OFF; signed data.\nAIN2 = excitation / 2; AIN3 = O2 bias.\nC508: AVDD/AVSS; C509: DVDD/DGND.\nKnown gases + controlled T/RH/pressure/flow."
		(at 352.425 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.889 0.889)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "20131a46-a447-4bb0-bfd7-8f7e7a6439bc")
	)
	(text "MD62 is a thermal-conductivity sensor, not selective to He. Conditioning and gas-specific calibration are mandatory; no factory He accuracy is specified."
		(at 20.32 271.78 0)
		(effects
